@startuml
title Partitioned Batch Flow (Overall Process)

start

:Trigger job
(FeedController / FeedService);

:Build and run job
(BatchPartitionedJavaConfig);

:Step 1 - SplitFeedTasklet;
note right
Input:
src/main/resources/feed.csv
Output:
batch-partitioned/input/part-0..7.csv
end note

:Step 2 - Partitioned processing;
:FilePartitioner creates execution contexts
for each part file;

fork
  :Worker p0;
  :PartitionCsvReader;
  :CsvToFeedRowProcessor;
  :Write out-0.csv
  (CsvLineAggregator / FeedRowToCsvExtractor);
fork again
  :Worker p1;
  :PartitionCsvReader;
  :CsvToFeedRowProcessor;
  :Write out-1.csv
  (CsvLineAggregator / FeedRowToCsvExtractor);
fork again
  :Worker p2..p7;
  :Same reader -> processor -> writer flow;
end fork

:Step 3 - MergePartitionOutputsTasklet;
note right
Input:
batch-partitioned/output/out-0..7.csv
Output:
output-partitioned.csv
end note

stop
@enduml